{"seq":2,"slug":"price-anomaly-detection-and-risk-control","title":"价格异常检测与风控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-channel-price-list-administration/price-list-governance/price-anomaly-detection-and-risk-control","wordCount":2323,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"价格异常检测与风控\">价格异常检测与风控</h1><p>一条价格从&quot;应该卖 19.90 美元&quot;变成&quot;实际卖了 0.19 美元&quot;，中间只差一个零，但它可能意味着六位数的账面损失、一次监管问询，或者渠道商的一封律师函。价格异常检测要做的事情，不是&quot;看住所有价格&quot;，而是把有限的审核人力对准真正会出事的那一小撮变更：被误删小数位的售价、超出授权区间的折扣、低于成本的清仓价、莫名其妙的整数跳变、以及同一商品在不同渠道上突然拉开的价差。风控则是把这些检出结果接上处置回路——拦截、复核、回滚、取证、上报。</p>\n<p>本篇聚焦价格数据上线之后的&quot;守夜&quot;环节。上一章 <a href=\"../price-list-version-effective/effective-overlap-conflict-and-rollback\">价目表版本与生效冲突回滚</a> 讲的是变更在<strong>写入前</strong>如何防冲突，本篇讲的是变更<strong>落地后</strong>如何被持续审视并触发处置。价格要素与字段口径见 <a href=\"../price-list-masterdata/price-list-types-and-price-elements\">价目表类型与价格要素</a>，渠道同步的下游影响见 <a href=\"../price-approval-distribution/price-list-distribution-and-channel-sync\">价目表分发与渠道同步</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>价格异常检测（price anomaly detection）与一般业务风控的根本区别在于<strong>信号的性价比极不对称</strong>：漏报一次&quot;售价被误改成 0.01&quot;的代价，往往远高于误报十次&quot;这个折扣看着有点大&quot;。因此价格风控的第一原则是<strong>召回优先、误报可容忍、处置分级</strong>，而不是追求一个干净的告警列表。</p>\n<p>这带来一个不同于信用风控的设计：规则与统计模型不是二选一，而是分层。硬规则（低于成本、非授权折扣、币种小数位越界）必须 100% 命中且即时阻断，因为它们的语义是确定的、可由合同或法规定义的；统计模型（时间序列突变、跨渠道价差、同品类离群）只负责<strong>排序</strong>，把可疑变更排到人工队列前面，而不是自动拦截一个它&quot;觉得奇怪&quot;的价格。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[价格变更事件流] --&gt; B[硬规则引擎&lt;br/&gt;确定性拦截]&#10;  A --&gt; C[统计基线&lt;br/&gt;时序/横截面离群]&#10;  B --&gt; D{命中硬规则?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[即时阻断 + 回滚]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[写入价格表]&#10;  C --&gt; G[风险评分]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H{分数区间}&#10;  H --&gt;|高| I[人工复核队列]&#10;  H --&gt;|中| J[抽样巡检]&#10;  H --&gt;|低| K[仅留痕]&#10;  E --&gt; L[事件台账 + 通知]&#10;  I --&gt; L\">graph TD\n  A[价格变更事件流] --&gt; B[硬规则引擎&lt;br/&gt;确定性拦截]\n  A --&gt; C[统计基线&lt;br/&gt;时序/横截面离群]\n  B --&gt; D{命中硬规则?}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[即时阻断 + 回滚]\n  D --&gt;|否| F[写入价格表]\n  C --&gt; G[风险评分]\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H{分数区间}\n  H --&gt;|高| I[人工复核队列]\n  H --&gt;|中| J[抽样巡检]\n  H --&gt;|低| K[仅留痕]\n  E --&gt; L[事件台账 + 通知]\n  I --&gt; L</pre><p>支撑这套结构的是<strong>基线</strong>：一个价格正常与否，只有相对它自身的历史、相对它的兄弟渠道、相对同品类商品才能判断。没有基线的异常检测只能退化成阈值告警，而固定阈值在通胀、汇率波动和促销季会立刻失效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"硬规则的判定与阈值\">硬规则的判定与阈值</h2><p>硬规则的价值在于它们不需要统计，只需要一个已经签字画押的边界值。边界来源有三类：成本、授权、法规。</p>\n<p>| 规则       | 判据                                               | 数据来源           | 处置                                      |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------------------------- | ------------------ | ----------------------------------------- | -------- | -------- |\n| 低于成本   | 净价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span></span></span></span></span> 单位落地成本 × (1 − 阈值)                 | 采购/物流成本表    | 即时阻断，需二次授权                      |\n| 非授权折扣 | 折扣率超出该渠道合同上限                           | 渠道合同、授权矩阵 | 阻断并通知价格经理                        |\n| 小数位越界 | 小数位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span></span></span></span></span> 币种 minor unit                         | ISO 4217           | 拒收该行                                  |\n| 突变超限   | <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>prev</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>jump</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">| \\Delta             | / p*{\\text{prev}} &gt; \\theta*{\\text{jump}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣Δ∣/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">prev</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">jump</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> | 历史价格 | 标记复核 |\n| 跨渠道价差 | <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>spread</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_i p_i / \\min_i p_i &gt; \\theta_{\\text{spread}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">spread</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> | 各渠道现价         | 标记复核                                  |\n| 合规价缺失 | 需含税市场未标注含税                               | 市场税制表         | 阻断分发                                  |</p>\n<p>小数位规则的依据是 ISO 4217 对每个货币代码规定的 minor unit：EUR、GBP、USD 为 2 位，JPY、KRW、VND 为 0 位，BHD、JOD、KWD、OMR 为 3 位（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_4217\">ISO 4217</a>）。把 <code>19.90</code> 写进日元栏是一个真实且高频的错误——它不是&quot;便宜了 100 倍&quot;，而是根本不是一个合法价格。</p>\n<p>突变阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>jump</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\text{jump}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">jump</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的取法不应该是拍脑袋的固定百分比。对高频调价的品类（如机票）20% 的跳变是常态，对工业备件 20% 的跳变几乎必然是错误。可行的做法是按品类历史波动率设定：令某 SKU 近 90 天的相对日波动率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>jump</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta\\_{\\text{jump}} = k \\cdot \\sigma_d, \\quad k \\in [4, 6]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">jump</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这样阈值随品类自适应，避免了全网一刀切。</p>\n<h2 id=\"统计与模型层-从时序突变到跨渠道离群\">统计与模型层：从时序突变到跨渠道离群</h2><p>统计层的目标不是判定，而是<strong>排序</strong>——给每个价格变更一个风险分，让人工队列按分降序处理。</p>\n<p><strong>时序突变检测。</strong> 最朴素也最可靠的是带季节性的基线：用同 SKU 近 N 天的成交价中位数与 MAD（median absolute deviation）构造稳健 z 分数，而不是用均值与标准差，因为均值本身会被异常点污染。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.6745</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z = \\frac{0.6745 \\,(p - \\tilde{p})}{\\mathrm{MAD}}, \\quad \\mathrm{MAD} = \\mathrm{median}(|p_i - \\tilde{p}|)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">MAD</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.6745</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">MAD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">median</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.6745</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.6745</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6745</span></span></span></span></span> 使 MAD 在正态假设下与标准差可比，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>3.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|z| &gt; 3.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.5</span></span></span></span></span> 是常用的离群门槛。</p>\n<p><strong>跨渠道价差。</strong> 同一 SKU 在 Amazon、TikTok Shop、独立站、线下经销商的挂牌价通常有一个稳定的相对结构。当某渠道的比值偏离历史比值超过若干倍稳健离散度时报警——这条规则能抓住&quot;某渠道价目表被整批导错&quot;这类事故。</p>\n<p><strong>首位数字分布。</strong> Benford 定律指出自然产生的数字，首位为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 的概率为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mn>10</mn><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(d) = \\log\\_{10}\\!\\left(1 + \\frac{1}{d}\\right), \\quad d = 1,\\dots,9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>真实价格分布常近似服从该律。若一个批次的报价首位数字分布显著偏离 Benford，往往意味着批量伪造、测试数据误入生产、或某次换算被统一乘上了错误系数（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Benford%27s_law\">Benford&#39;s law</a>）。它是批次级筛子，不是单条判据。</p>\n<p>值得注意的是，2026 年的价格风险已不止于&quot;改错了&quot;。欧盟、英国与美国各州对<strong>算法定价与个性化定价</strong>的监管持续收紧：英国《数字市场、竞争与消费者法》（DMCCA 2024）明确禁止包含&quot;滴水定价&quot;（drip pricing）在内的误导性定价行为并赋予 CMA 直接处罚权；欧盟《消费者保护合作条例》与 Omnibus 指令（EU 2019/2161）要求促销降价必须标注<strong>此前 30 天的最低价</strong>（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dir/2019/2161/oj\">EU Directive 2019/2161</a>）。这意味着&quot;原价划线&quot;本身也成了风控对象：虚高的划线价就是一条合规异常（<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/competition-and-markets-authority\">CMA guidance on the DMCCA</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"处置回路与证据留存\">处置回路与证据留存</h2><p>检出而不处置等于没检出。价格风控的处置回路必须回答四个问题：谁被通知、多久内响应、能否自动回滚、如何取证。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[异常事件] --&gt; B{严重度分级}&#10;  B --&gt;|P0 资金/合规| C[即时自动回滚&lt;br/&gt;+ 5 分钟内通知价格经理]&#10;  B --&gt;|P1 疑似错误| D[冻结该条变更&lt;br/&gt;+ 值班复核队列]&#10;  B --&gt;|P2 观察| E[抽样巡检 + 日报]&#10;  C --&gt; F[事件台账]&#10;  D --&gt; G{复核结论}&#10;  G --&gt;|确认错误| F&#10;  G --&gt;|判定正常| H[标记白名单/调阈值]&#10;  H --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; I[周度复盘&lt;br/&gt;规则命中率/误报率]&#10;  I --&gt; J[阈值与规则迭代]\">graph TD\n  A[异常事件] --&gt; B{严重度分级}\n  B --&gt;|P0 资金/合规| C[即时自动回滚&lt;br/&gt;+ 5 分钟内通知价格经理]\n  B --&gt;|P1 疑似错误| D[冻结该条变更&lt;br/&gt;+ 值班复核队列]\n  B --&gt;|P2 观察| E[抽样巡检 + 日报]\n  C --&gt; F[事件台账]\n  D --&gt; G{复核结论}\n  G --&gt;|确认错误| F\n  G --&gt;|判定正常| H[标记白名单/调阈值]\n  H --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; I[周度复盘&lt;br/&gt;规则命中率/误报率]\n  I --&gt; J[阈值与规则迭代]</pre><p><strong>自动回滚的前提是快照可用。</strong> 只有当价格表每次变更都保留了带时间戳的不可变快照，回滚才是一次原子操作而非一次人工重录——这正是 <a href=\"../price-list-version-effective/price-list-versioning-and-snapshot\">价目表版本化与快照</a> 存在的理由。没有快照的&quot;回滚&quot;实际上是重新发布，会把错误再扩散一次。</p>\n<p><strong>取证要求决定了留痕的最小字段。</strong> 一个可审计的价格异常事件至少应记录：发生时间、SKU 与渠道、变更前值、变更后值、触发规则或风险分、变更发起身份、检测耗时、处置动作与执行者、外部渠道是否已同步该错误价。若错误价格已推送到 Google Merchant Center 等外部渠道，留痕字段还必须包含下架或修正的确认时间——因为对外展示的价格与落地页、结算页一致是平台的硬性要求，价格不得按用户地理位置变化，折扣必须人人可得且在页面明示，会员价须走 <code>loyalty_program</code> 字段而非 <code>price</code> 字段（<a href=\"https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/6324371\">Google Merchant Center price 规范</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>分级阈值不是拍出来的，是跑出来的。</strong> 建议以规则命中率与误报率作为迭代输入：某条规则一周内命中 200 次但复核确认率低于 5%，说明阈值松了；某类事故反复发生后被检测到但都是在客户投诉之后，说明召回有洞，应回补规则而非调松阈值。这与 <a href=\"../price-list-version-effective/effective-overlap-conflict-and-rollback\">价目表版本与生效冲突回滚</a> 中的冲突规则共用同一套规则库与来源标注纪律：每条规则都要能说出它的依据（合同条款、法规条文或统计基线），说不出依据的规则不应进入生产。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>价格风控的首要目标是<strong>召回优先</strong>：漏报一次误价事故的代价远高于若干次误报，因此硬规则拦截、统计模型排序、人工队列分级处置三者必须分工而非互相替代。</li>\n<li>硬规则的边界来自<strong>成本、授权、法规</strong>三类确定来源；小数位按 ISO 4217 的 minor unit 校验，合规价按市场税制校验，授权折扣按渠道合同校验。</li>\n<li>统计层用稳健统计（中位数 + MAD 的 z 分数）、跨渠道比值偏离与 Benford 批次筛子来排序风险，阈值应按品类波动率自适应，而非全网固定。</li>\n<li>2026 年的合规异常已延伸到<strong>划线价与个性化定价</strong>：德/欧盟促销须标注此前 30 天最低价，英国 DMCCA 2024 直接禁止滴水定价并授权 CMA 处罚，虚高划线价本身就是风控对象。</li>\n<li>处置回路必须有<strong>快照支撑的原子回滚</strong>、明确的响应时限、以及可审计的留痕字段（含外部渠道修正确认），并以命中率/误报率驱动规则迭代。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  P[价格风控] --&gt; R[硬规则&lt;br/&gt;成本/授权/法规]&#10;  P --&gt; S[统计模型&lt;br/&gt;时序/横截面/Benford]&#10;  P --&gt; T[处置回路&lt;br/&gt;回滚/复核/取证]&#10;  R --&gt; U[确定边界拦截]&#10;  S --&gt; V[风险排序]&#10;  T --&gt; W[事件台账与迭代]&#10;  W --&gt; R&#10;  W --&gt; S\">graph TD\n  P[价格风控] --&gt; R[硬规则&lt;br/&gt;成本/授权/法规]\n  P --&gt; S[统计模型&lt;br/&gt;时序/横截面/Benford]\n  P --&gt; T[处置回路&lt;br/&gt;回滚/复核/取证]\n  R --&gt; U[确定边界拦截]\n  S --&gt; V[风险排序]\n  T --&gt; W[事件台账与迭代]\n  W --&gt; R\n  W --&gt; S</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"价格异常检测与风控","id":"价格异常检测与风控"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"硬规则的判定与阈值","id":"硬规则的判定与阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"统计与模型层：从时序突变到跨渠道离群","id":"统计与模型层-从时序突变到跨渠道离群"},{"level":2,"text":"处置回路与证据留存","id":"处置回路与证据留存"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"价格审计轨迹与合规留痕","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-channel-price-list-administration/price-list-governance/price-audit-trail-and-compliance-evidence"},"next":{"title":"价格表治理度量与 KPI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-channel-price-list-administration/price-list-governance/price-list-governance-metrics-and-kpi"}}